Source: php-llamacpp
Section: php
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Alan Knowles <alan@roojs.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               dh-php,
               php-all-dev,
               pkgconf,
               libllama-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/roojs/php-llamacpp

Package: php@PHP_VERSION@-llamacpp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${php:Depends},
         libllama0
Description: PHP @PHP_VERSION@ extension for local GGUF embeddings
 LlamaEmbed loads a GGUF model through libllama and returns
 L2-normalized embedding vectors.
 .
 This package is the llamacpp module for PHP @PHP_VERSION@.
 phpenmod enables it for every SAPI of that PHP (cli, fpm, apache2,
 and the rest). A SAPI installed later picks the module up from
 that registry.
